        "090a05a9-c530-405c-8480-12d5b201f814": {
          "type": "entry",
          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": false,
            "title": "Which is the best lawnmower?",
            "text": "<p>When choosing the best lawnmower for you, consider factors like lawn size, gradient, collection type and availability of power sockets. <a href=\"/collections/cordless-lawn-mowers\" title=\"Cordless Lawn Mowers\">Cordless lawn mowers</a> are ideal if you don't have an outdoor power socket.</p>",
